<section class="py-24 px-4 bg-base-100">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60">Last updated: February 18, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Account information:</strong>
        When you create an account, we collect your email address. This is used solely for
        authentication and transactional communication (such as login links).
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Audio recordings:</strong>
        When you use Spiel, you may record audio describing your career experience. These recordings
        are processed by third-party transcription services to generate text, which is then used to
        create your resume. Audio files are not retained after transcription is complete.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Resume content:</strong>
        The career information you provide (through transcription or direct input) and the resumes
        generated from it are stored in your account so you can access and manage them.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-4">
        <li>Provide and operate the Spiel service</li>
        <li>Send transactional emails (login links, account notifications)</li>
        <li>Generate and store your resumes</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do <strong>not</strong> use your information for marketing, advertising, or any purpose
        unrelated to providing the service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">3. Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties, except:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Transcription services:</strong>
          Audio recordings are sent to third-party providers for transcription. These providers
          process the audio solely to return a transcript and do not retain your data.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>AI services:</strong>
          Career information is processed by AI providers to generate and refine resume content.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Legal requirements:</strong>
          We may disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is stored securely using industry-standard practices. We use encryption in transit
        and at rest. While no system is perfectly secure, we take reasonable measures to protect your
        information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You can:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 ml-4">
        <li>Access and download your resume data at any time</li>
        <li>Delete your account and associated data by contacting us</li>
        <li>Request information about what data we hold about you</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">6. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Spiel uses only essential cookies required for authentication and session management. We do
        not use analytics tracking, advertising cookies, or third-party trackers.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant
        changes via email or through the service.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-base-content">8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this privacy policy or your data, please contact us at <a
          href="mailto:support@giveyourspiel.app"
          class="link link-primary"
        >support@giveyourspiel.app</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
